Cell["\<\
On a path the whole graph is a line; any proper stretch is not, since it can \
still be prolonged.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"fb8299a6-dc09-440e-81a7-6e1429b513ed"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
